				"description": "{H7 Memorial Advanced Exchange}\n\nAn exchange in memory of H7: swaps creatures of the seven original towns (Castle, Rampart, Tower, Necropolis, Dungeon, Stronghold, Fortress) with H7 creatures of the same faction and level (levels 1-7; H7 Fortress pairs with Fortress). Basic creatures swap for basic creatures; upgraded creatures of the same line (original upgrades, H7 upgrades, and upgrades from the Tides of War and Third Upgrades mods) can be swapped freely among one another; both level 7 Champions pair with the original level 7 creature. Shrunk and Downgraded troops (any level) can be restored to their original form here. Free, with unlimited visits; you pay the difference only when exchanging into the more expensive Tides of War or Third Upgrades forms (or from them into a more expensive form), in batches by count. Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again.",
